 "notes": "Plan of the cargo ship Donator (Prosper Schiaffino), 78.3 x 12 m, upright on flat sand at 48 m between Porquerolles and Port-Cros, about 430 m WSW of Le Grec. Position 42 59.592 N 6 16.436 E from the Port-Cros national park Neptune sheet (Wikipedia gives a point 700 m further NE). The stern points south-east (the bow is drawn at 315 deg) per Joncheray and Brunner's Portraits d'épaves as quoted by several club pages; the feature order and depths (propeller 51 m, stern castle 41 m, midships 35-37 m, holds 44-45 m, bow 48 m) come from nicoblon.free.fr. Shot-line positions and all positions along the hull are approximate. The site file's coordinates (6.2023 E) are about 6 km too far west.",
